WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.167
-You love taking
your little ones

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:04.033
to the Macy's Thanksgiving Day
Parade.

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:05.434
-Pick me up, pick me up!

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:07.667
-And they love watching
the parade from your shoulders.

00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:09.701
But we all know what happens
when they're up there

00:00:09.701 --> 00:00:12.601
for a three-hour parade.
-Daddy, I have to go

00:00:12.601 --> 00:00:14.367
to the bathroom.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:15.901
-We're kind of stuck,
can you hold it, pal?

00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:19.033
-Accidents happen.

00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:20.834
-Ugh, come on, kid.

00:00:20.834 --> 00:00:24.334
-So for this year's parade,
Patagonia and Pampers

00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:26.200
teamed up to create the all-new

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.501
Peetagonia.

00:00:27.501 --> 00:00:29.534
The first jacket
with a built-in neck diaper

00:00:29.534 --> 00:00:31.267
to keep you dry
when the kid on your shoulders

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:33.100
treats you like a human urinal.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:36.267
-Daddy, I have to go
to the bathroom.

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:37.334
-Go right ahead.

00:00:37.334 --> 00:00:39.000
I'm wearing my Peetagonia.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.434
♪ Let it flow, let it flow,
let it flow ♪

00:00:41.434 --> 00:00:43.167
-You'll stay completely dry.

00:00:43.167 --> 00:00:45.033
-And warm, too.

00:00:45.033 --> 00:00:46.467
-Oh, hell no.

00:00:46.467 --> 00:00:47.734
Come -- Come on.

00:00:47.734 --> 00:00:51.968
-Peetagonia --
Let it rain on your parade!

